  "stop_conditions": [
    "Return BLOCKED on any subject or authority mismatch.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if any identity, exact-byte selection, persistence, replay, orphan, migration, recovery, refusal, evidence-preservation, negative, schema, or cross-document rule is incomplete, ambiguous, contradictory, cyclic, or broader than selected candidate 1.3.",
    "Do not waive or repair findings, create records, resume implementation, or begin HCM-2.3.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if any Review 1 finding is only partially remediated or if any selected candidate-1.3 authority remains copied from candidate 1.2.",
    "Return CHANGES_REQUIRED if result discovery differs from the authoritative state store, any selected intent exact output differs from its runtime record, transaction 0002 is reused, or filename below/at/above and owned-name positives are incomplete."
